    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277820</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>やっほ、こちら「ガーリック」です
ほしいものはあるかな？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Heya, this is "Garlic." Is
there something you're after?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277824</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>_shop_</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>_shop_</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Done</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277828</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>どうも、どうもです～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Thanks, thanks much~</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277832</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ミッドガルズが滅びて久しい……
ヴァルハラの栄えも
いつまでのことか……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's been a long, long time since
Midgard was destroyed... How long
will Valhalla's prosperity last...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277832</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>この世の移ろいは
実に急く滝川のように
早い……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The caprice of this world is
not unlike the swift currents
of a great mountain river...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277836</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>すべてがすべて砂に飲まれて、
無に帰していく、
この砂原こそ、すべての終着点……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>These plains of sand are the ultimate
conclusion of all... All things will be
devoured by the sands of time...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277840</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>世は諸行無常なり。
永久とも思われるマナも
根っこからすべて枯れる時が来る</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>From ashes to ashes, from dust to dust.
That is the way of this world. Even mana,
now thought eternal, will one day dry up.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277840</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>魔法なるものは
このひとときの人を支える
ただひとときの力にすぎぬ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What we call magic is but a momentary
power, which grants momentary support to
people who themselves last but a moment.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277844</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>長い悠久の時間にくらぶれば
人の世など
夢まぼろしの如くなり</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The human world is as
a fleeting dream in the
face of true eternity.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277844</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ましてや我が生涯など
風の前の塵に同じ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And a single life is nothing
more than dust in the wind.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277848</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>人の生涯は
何も終えないためにあるもの。
だからこそ人は子をなす</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The purpose of human life is
to defy endings. And that is
why humans create children.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277848</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>親から子へ意思は受け継がれ
少しずつ世界は形を変えていく</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>A parent's will passes to their child, and in
that way, the world changes, bit by bit.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277852</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>最大の不幸は子が親よりも
早く死ぬこと、
それは世界的な大罪だ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The greatest misfortune is for a child
to die while their parents yet live. It's
an affront to the very world itself.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277852</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>意思は引き継がれず
世界のうつろいの糸を
ひとつ切ることに他ならない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>A will uninherited. A single thread
which guides the world, severed. One
must mistake it for nothing less.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277856</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>知ってるかい？
魔女ってやつがしてる
悪事の噂</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Have you heard? There's a rumor
going around about that witch.
She did something nasty again!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277856</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>オアシスの水
全部飲んじまったらしいよ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>She drank an entire oasis
dry of water, or so I heard!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277856</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ひどい話だよね～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Terrible, isn't it~</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277860</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>魔女の悪事、他にも
いろいろ聞いてるよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I've heard a lot about
that witch's nasty tricks.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277860</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>キャラバンを
砂漠の落とし穴に落としたりさ、
いろいろ派手な悪事をね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>A lot of her tricks are really flashy. Like
one time, she dug a huge pitfall and
dropped an entire desert caravan into it!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277864</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>魔女のやつ、今度は
北の山にたくさん杉の木を
植えたそうだよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This time, that witch planted
a bunch of cedar trees in
the mountains to the north.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277864</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>季節になるとスギ花粉が飛んで
みんなヒドイことになるんだって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So now as the seasons change,
there's tons of cedar pollen, and
everyone's suffering with hay fever!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277868</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>確かにハンパないこと
やってのけてるけど、
悪いことには違いないからね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, yes, the stuff she does is
pretty incredible, but it's also just so
nasty and dreadful, don't you think?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277868</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>このあいだなんて、私が
食べるはずだったアジのひらきが
空を飛んでたんだからね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I mean, listen to this. I was trying to
eat some dried mackerel recently, and
then it just flew right up into the sky!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277872</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>魔女が悪事をしてたって
ウソらしいよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So it turns out all of those
stories about the witch's nasty
tricks might have been lies.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277872</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いや、ウソじゃないけど
なんかみんな
尾ひれ背ひれがついてたみたいね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Okay, well, not really lies, but
everyone was stretching the
truth a bit. Or so it seems!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277876</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>子どもさらったってのは
子どもが勝手に
ついてっただけみたいだし</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It turns out the children she kidnapped
weren't really kidnapped per se, but
followed her home without asking...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277876</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>納屋に火をつけたってのも
あれは放火したヤツが
魔女のせいにしたっぽいね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And the barn she set fire to? Looks
like someone else set the fire, then
told everyone the witch did it!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277880</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>やっほ、こちら「ガーリック」です
ほしいものはあるかな？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Heya, this is "Garlic." Is
there something you're after?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277884</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>_shop_</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>_shop_</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <Status>Done</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277888</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>どうも、どうもです～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Thanks, thanks much~</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277892</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>はい、どーも～
「ガーリック」です</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, good to see
ya~ This is "Garlic."</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277892</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>名前だけでも
覚えてってください～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Just try and remember
our name, at least~</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277896</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>_shop_</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>_shop_</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <Status>Done</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277900</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>お買い物は
お済みですか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Is that all your
shopping done?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277900</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>どーも、おおきに！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Much obliged!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277904</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ヴァルハラでまた
１００年前のような
大きな軍事行動があるらしい</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It seems there's been another big
military action in Valhalla, not
unlike the one 100 years ago.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>36</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277904</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ずっと戦争もなく
平和な時代が続いた
というのに……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We'd been living in
peace—no wars at all—
for so long, and yet...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>36</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277908</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>美女魔女&lt;Arche&gt;が現れて
この争いを鎮めてくれない
ものだろうか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I wonder if Witchy Beauty
&lt;Arche&gt; won't appear and
settle this conflict herself.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>38</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277908</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あ、美女魔女&lt;Arche&gt;ってのは
１００年前に仲間を連れて
魔王を倒した素敵な魔女のことだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, Witchy Beauty &lt;Arche&gt; is the amazing
witch who defeated Dhaos 100 years ago.
With a few of her comrades.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>38</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277912</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ヴァルハラの戦いはどうやら
終わったらしい</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It seems the battle
in Valhalla is over.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>40</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277912</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>今回は美女魔女&lt;Arche&gt;の
活躍はなかったのだろうか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I guess Witchy Beauty &lt;Arche&gt; didn't
get to show her stuff this time.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>40</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277916</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>美女魔女&lt;Arche&gt;か……
もし今の時代に生きているなら
一度お目にかかりたいものだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Witchy Beauty &lt;Arche&gt;... If she's
still alive now, I'd like to see
her in person at least once.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>42</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277916</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ついていきます、お姉さま！
みたいな感じの
方なのだろうか……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I wonder if she's the type who commands
respect... Like, "I'd follow you to the
ends of the earth, &lt;Arche&gt;-sama!"</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>42</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277920</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>美女魔女&lt;Arche&gt;に会いたい……
そんなふうに考えていた時期が
私にもあった</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>"I want to meet Witchy Beauty
&lt;Arche&gt;..." Even I thought like
that, at one time in my life.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>44</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277920</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>今ではむしろ、
彼女は妄想に生きているから
美しいのだと思っています</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But now, I think living
in a world of fantasy is
what makes her beautiful.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>44</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277924</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>美女だと期待して
拍子抜けなんてことは
決して少なくない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's not uncommon for one to hope and
believe that their idol is a beautiful
maiden, only to be betrayed by reality.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>46</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277924</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それを思えば、
会わないに越したことはない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>When I think of it that way,
having never met her is the
greatest possible blessing.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>46</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277928</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>「紅の月」が採掘できるとかで
ヴァルハラに採掘団が
大量に押しかけてた矢先よ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>At this very moment, countless miners are
forcing their ways into Valhalla, hoping
to dig up that "Crimson Moon" stuff.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>48</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277928</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そんな時にシグルドの連中に
占領されるなんて
気の毒な話だわ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's awful that those Sigurd
people have taken over the
village at the very same time.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>48</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277932</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そう言えばヴァルハラに向かう
大勢の採掘団の連中が
この村を通ってったっけね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Actually, I'm pretty sure a lot
of those miners passed through
here on their way to Valhalla.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>50</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277932</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>金儲けに目がない連中、
みんな一攫千金を狙おうと
してるのよ、はかない夢だわ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>People with a mind for profit are
always looking to hit the easy jackpots.
Got their heads lost in the clouds.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>50</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277936</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>もともと採掘団とヴァルハラ住民は
いろいろもめてたのよね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>At first, the miners and the
Valhalla natives were at odds
over a whole lot of things.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>52</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277936</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>移住者も原住者も
仲良くしてほしいわね、
この街みたいにさ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It'd be nice if the new arrivals and
the long-time residents could all get
along. Like we do here, you know?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>52</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277940</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>もともとのヴァルハラ住民は
採掘団に追い出されたのよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The original Valhalla residents
were driven out by the miners.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>54</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277940</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>気の毒ね……
どこへ行ったのかしら？
他人事ながら気にかかるわ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's awful, isn't it... I wonder where
they all went? It's not my problem,
really, but I still worry for them.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>54</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277944</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>シグルドのリーダー、ブレイナー
はもともとヴァルハラの住民で
街の仕切り役だったんですって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>They're saying Sigurd's leader, Brynhildr,
was originally a Valhalla resident, himself,
and he was trying to settle the score.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>56</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277944</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>どこで彼の運命が
くるってしまったのかしら……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I wonder when his fate
went so far astray...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>56</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277948</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ブレイナーは掘り返された
「紅の月」の坑道を
埋めなおしてたんだって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Brynhildr reburied a lot of
the "Crimson Moon" mine
shafts they'd excavated.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>58</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277948</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>大勢の採掘者が
生き埋めになったって
話よ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Rumor is, he buried a lot
of the miners alive, too!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>58</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277952</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ようこそようこそ、
ここは「ガーリック」武器店</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Welcome, welcome. This is
"Garlic," the weapon shop.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>60</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277952</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>何いるよ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Whaddya need?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>60</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277956</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>_shop_</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>_shop_</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>62</Id>
      <Status>Done</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277960</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>どうも、まいどあり</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Thanks much, come again.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>63</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277964</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>バジリスクって知ってる？
昔は倒すのが大変な
手ごわい怪物だったんだって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Have you heard of basilisks?
They're monsters, and used to be
really scary and tough to beat.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>64</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277964</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>最近、簡単に倒せる方法を
討伐隊の人たちが
見つけたんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But the subjugation squad
found an easy way to
beat them just recently.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>64</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277968</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>バジリスクが全滅したら
砂漠を渡るのも
少し楽になるよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If the basilisks get wiped
out, it'll be a little easier
to cross the desert.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>66</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277968</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうなると
この街に来る人は少なくなるね、
それっていいのかな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And then not so many people
will need to stay in this village.
I wonder if that's a good thing...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>66</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277972</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>バジリスクの弱点が
発見されたらしいよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It seems like they've found
the basilisks' weak point.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>68</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277972</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>討伐隊の士気は上がって
砂漠でバジリスク掃討戦が
展開されてる</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The subjugation squad got a big
morale boost from it, and now they're
trying to wipe out all the basilisks.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>68</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277976</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>このまま行くと
危険な生物バジリスクは
この世から姿を消すだろうね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So at this rate, the much-feared
basilisk will disappear from the
world without a trace.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>70</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277976</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それはいいことかもだけど
なんかもやもやするよ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Maybe that's a good thing, but
it feels a little wrong somehow...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>70</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277980</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>バジリスク掃討が
進んでるんだって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>They're trying to wipe out
the last of the basilisks.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>72</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277980</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>暑いのに
ご苦労さんだよねー</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's so hot, but they're still
giving it their all out there.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>72</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277984</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>人間に害がある動物を
殺すのって人間の
勝手だよね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's a bit selfish of humans,
though. If an animals is a
threat to us, we kill it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>74</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277984</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>こういうの
エゴっていうんだっけ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Isn't that what they
call, um... "Egoism"?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>74</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277984</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも、安全に暮らしたいよね、
悩むよね～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But, I want a safe life,
too. Ah, I dunno~</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>74</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277988</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>半年ほど前、世界は
ひとりの男によって
滅亡の危機にさらされました</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>About half a year ago, the
world was nearly driven to
destruction by a single man.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>77</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277988</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そこにさっそうと現れたのは
「美女魔女&lt;Arche&gt;と仲間たち」
だったのです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And that's when "Witchy
Beauty &lt;Arche&gt; and Comrades"
made their gallant entrance.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>77</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277992</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>「美女魔女&lt;Arche&gt;（略）」は
スーパーミラクルな奇跡で
その男を一撃で倒したのです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>"Witchy Beauty &lt;Arche&gt;" (abbr.) used
their "Super Miracle Wonder" to defeat
that man with but a single blow.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>79</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277992</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>強いぞ、美女魔女&lt;Arche&gt;、
まぁまぁスゴイぞ、
その仲間たち！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Witchy Beauty &lt;Arche&gt; is incredibly
powerful, you know! And her comrades
are kind of incredible, too, I guess.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>79</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277996</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>「美女魔女&lt;Arche&gt;と仲間たち」
は美女魔女&lt;Arche&gt;が
率いた時空戦隊です</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>"Witchy Beauty &lt;Arche&gt; and Comrades"
was a band of time-traveling warriors
once led by Witchy Beauty &lt;Arche&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>81</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277996</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>この前、この村に来た
ピンク髪の女の子が
言っていました</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I was told all about it by a
pink-haired girl who came
to this village once before.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>81</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278000</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>美女魔女&lt;Arche&gt;……
きっと奇跡のようで
魔法のような美貌なのでしょう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Witchy Beauty &lt;Arche&gt;... I'm sure her
beauty and charm are miraculous—
magical, even—in and of themselves.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>83</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278000</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ばいーんで、きゅっとして
どーん！という感じに
違いありません！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>"Bang! Hrrrrnn, kaboom!"
Must be that kind of
vibe! Yes, I'm sure of it!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>83</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278004</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>「美女魔女&lt;Arche&gt;」のことを
私は長く語り継ごうかと
私は思います</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I believe I'll stay here and pass
down the tales of "Witchy Beauty
&lt;Arche&gt;" for a long time to come.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>85</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278004</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>何しろ、この世界を
救ってくれた人なのですから</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>After all, she's the one
who saved our world.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>85</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278008</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ああ、「美女魔女」……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ahh, "Witchy Beauty"...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>87</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278008</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>想像だけでご飯三杯は
軽く食えます</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Why would I need food? These
imaginings alone are more
than enough to sustain me.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>87</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
